  "caveats": [
    "Packet assignment snapshots precede bottom-packing; remembered offsets are material-center provenance, not a reconstruction of the free surface.",
    "Constituent target-depth inversions with different remembered lateral positions do not alone prove intersecting physical strata.",
    "Reordering parcels within one destination column preserves its summed unit bulk and grain totals immediately; lateral assignment or later physical operations must change those totals.",
    "Paired trajectories have tiny pre-existing source-state differences; the extra full packet has weight1 under both objectives, so its changed placement is a coupled allocation effect, not simply its own weight changing.",
    "Closed budgets establish grain conservation, not local geometric accuracy or convergence. This diagnosis isolates the 40m trajectory and does not make the 10m result physical truth.",
    "These traces reproduce the frozen synthetic baseline; metrics, eligibility, development observations and holdout were not changed."
  ]
